WEB SOURCE (the specification)
  web/src/features/telemetry/components/SignalChartPanel.tsx — a PURE presentational panel owning no data
  fetching. It is fed `selectedSignals`, `data` (rows sorted ascending by timestamp), `stats`, plus the
  presentation props `isLive` / `loading` / `pointsLoaded` / `liveEventCount` / `title` / `height` /
  `chartMode` ('overlay'|'grid'|'auto') / `gridAutoThreshold` (8) / `gridCellHeight` (140). Composition:
    FadeIn > GlassPanel(p-4 sm:p-5) >
      • header (always): Radio(red,pulse) when isLive else BarChart3(neon-cyan); the resolved title
        (`title ?? (isLive ? t('Live Signal Stream') : t('Signal Chart'))`); a right-aligned counter —
        live: "<fmtInt(liveEventCount)> {t('events')} · <fmtInt(data.length)> {t('points')}" (red, pulse dot);
        historical (data.length>0 && pointsLoaded!=null): "<fmtInt(pointsLoaded)> {t('points loaded')}" (muted).
      • body branches, in order:
          1. loading && !isLive            → <Skeleton h-full>
          2. data.length>0 && grid         → <SmallMultiplesChart series=selectedSignals cellHeight syncId>
             data.length>0 && overlay      → <LineChart> with <Line> per signal, optional dual Y axis
                                              (useRightAxis ⇒ series index 1 on the right), <Tooltip
                                              content={ChartTooltip}>, interactive <Legend>, time X axis.
          3. isLive (empty)                → Radio + t('Waiting for signal data…')
          4. else (empty)                  → Activity + t('No data for this time range')
  Derived logic ported verbatim:
      useRightAxis  = stats.length>=2 && (r0/r1>10 || r1/r0>10) where ri=|max-min|||1.
      effectiveMode = overlay⇒overlay; grid⇒(len>=2?grid:overlay); auto⇒(len>gridAutoThreshold?grid:overlay).
      <Line yAxisId> = useRightAxis && i===1 ? 'right' : 'left'; connectNulls; isAnimationActive={!isLive}.
  Data sources (per prompt): useTranslation, useDateFormat. No data hooks (the panel renders what it's given).
  i18n keys extracted from source (web keys on the English text, i18next default):
      'Live Signal Stream', 'Signal Chart', 'events', 'points', 'points loaded',
      'Waiting for signal data…', 'No data for this time range'.

