PARITY MAPPING (web → Apple, ADR-002/004/009)
  FadeIn/GlassPanel        → TSFadeIn + tsGlassPanel() (system material, P1/S9 token border).
  Skeleton                 → TSChartSkeleton (reduce-motion-aware shimmer).
  recharts LineChart/Line  → Swift `Chart { ForEach … LineMark(series:) }` with TSChartPalette colors.
  recharts dual Y axis     → primary `chartYScale` + right series rescaled onto it + relabelled trailing
                             AxisMarks (the native equivalent of recharts' independent axes).
  recharts Tooltip/ChartTooltip → chartXSelection cursor RuleMark + bespoke SignalChartTooltipView.
  recharts Legend          → SignalChartLegendView (tap-to-toggle, VoiceOver button/selected traits).
  SmallMultiplesChart      → shared TSSmallMultiplesChart (one cell per signal).
  lucide Radio/BarChart3/Activity → SF Symbols dot.radiowaves.left.and.right / chart.bar / waveform.path.ecg.
  text-red-*/neon-cyan/var(--text-muted) → Color.TS.statusDanger / .accent / .textMuted (ADR-006 semantic).
  useDateFormat().formatTime → SignalSample.timeLabel bound at the P1/S8 seam (view stays pure + testable).

STATES (every one renders — no hidden surface)
  loading (skeleton, only when !isLive) · data (overlay or grid) · emptyLive ("Waiting for signal data…") ·
  emptyHistorical ("No data for this time range") · error (QueryError peer + retry) · stale (freshness chip +
  one-shot auto-refresh) · offline (freshness chip; cached chart kept, never blanked). All exercised by the
  previews and asserted by the projection/model tests.

